<title>USA: Prosoft names Baird as COO.</title>
<headline>Prosoft names Baird as COO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prosoft I-Net Solutions Inc said on Tuesday Jerrell Baird has joined Prosoft as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Baird formerly served as chief information officer of International Business Machines Corp Consumer Product Division.</p>
</text>
